## CODE

W_HEADER 3
W_SECTION DATA, "data"
W_SECTION CODE, "code"
W_SECTION SYMBOLS, "symb"
W_SECTION FUNC, "fext"
W_END_HEADER

DATA:
  W_STRING "___"

SYM_MAIN:
  W_STRING "main"

SYMBOLS:
  W_SYMBOL SYM_MAIN

CODE:
  NOP

Fmain:
STACK_RESERVE 0
NEW_ARRAY R0
NEW_ARRAY R1
MOV R0, R1
MOV R1, R1
RELEASE R0
RELEASE R1
RETURN RNIL

FUNC:
  W_METHOD 0, -1, Fmain, 0, 0, 0
  W_METHOD_ARG 0, 0

## COMMENT

Overwriting R0 must release its original array. Self-assigning R1 must not retain
it again. Releasing the final two register owners must free both arrays.

## OPTIONS

--noraw

## TESTCASE

$leaktest

## EXPECT

leaktest: no leaks
